description:
Design a circuit that reverses the bit order of a 4-bit input, effectively converting it from a big-endian format to a little-endian format. The output will reflect the input bits arranged from least significant to most significant, such that if the input is represented as in[3:0], the output will correspond to out[3:0] = in[0], in[1], in[2], in[3].
module top_module(
    input [3:0] in,
    output reg [3:0] out
);

